{"id":1756,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>6月4日下午，中北大学第三届“阳光杯”沙滩排球赛于中区沙滩排球场圆满收官。我院男子沙排代表队积极参赛，全体队员凝心聚力、刻苦备战。</p><p>赛场上风沙扑面，队员们始终默契配合，一传二传衔接流畅，起跳拦网、大力扣杀有条不紊。面对各学院强劲对手，大家沉着冷静，永不言弃，每一轮都拼尽全力，充分发扬团结拼搏的竞技精神。</p><p>此次赛事，队员们用汗水展现了我院学子奋勇争先的青春风采，以团结协作书写赛场荣光，激励学子们在赛场与学业中不断奋进，绽放独属于青年的耀眼光彩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FU4f97Mzn2Ul-iLA4VVUmnkM7-sL8L1iLR9sMm9ZnzQ7nNU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYysMkyDn1hVoRWkolU8L4TRoz-PUlLDnmfVn7LDnmGinRfFo7-iL4-DMmWFMRlZozLJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL8M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11346&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C746FE82B9D439C921AC6F0EDC6F05D0/8B532662/45893\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FMmT9fnRL8Mmv4nANVVMzMRnNQkoR91ZLzWfoRGYLmnfL4G0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyaokyDLYyDn7liMzA2ozfRMNUan7U8nRGioR7PM8CZMzAFL8lbnmf7n7QFn7UaUm7Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL8M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11346&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FnR-9inzWfMzGbnAlU8o7liLz-PUz71PMzUDLm9DL8M7Ull0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yZLkhVMkyaLm-bMm9Zn7nknlQfo7lbLmAkoR7sL7CZM4WFUzGan77YM46FLmrRoz-Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL8M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11346&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/280E40229688DDBEFA8E928B8170F872/A00DA277/25C92\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 295px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FnR-9inzWfMzGbnAlU8o7liLz-PUz71PMzUDLm9DL8M7Ull0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yZLkhVMkyaLm-bMm9Zn7nknlQfo7lbLmAkoR7sL7CZM4WFUzGan77YM46FLmrRoz-Jqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL8M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11346&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FMzl9iM4CinRNYMA7lbnNMfUzUPnm71bUNMkMNlYL8CaolC0gihFp2hmCIa0UShRnkhknShkUzCbM7Csozfkoz7DLRLsL4UbLN7ZLmNZM7WFMm-snN-iUmTFoz6VLRlJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzL8M1bw62m8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11346&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ACDBEBA694F790B9160373492A82984B/627FB5B9/97E05\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 589px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_atta